  "quest.298C76D8B303A1D7.quest_desc": [
    "You unlocked this chapter from Getting Started → &eRandon Mined&r.",
    "",
    "Every center-block break adds one to your team's &eRandon Mined&r counter. This tab is the roadmap for what that number unlocks.",
