    "&aAuto pool unlocks&r:",
    "• &e500&r — BBL Utility (&futility&r)",
    "• &e2,500&r — Easy Ore Generation",
    "",
    "&dChoice tokens&r (claim side-quests appear after the threshold):",
    "• &e1,000&r — Dark Utils &ror&r Apotheosis (+ Enchanting)",
    "• &e5,000&r — whichever of those two remains",
    "",
    "Commands: &f/randomblock counter&r · &fmilestones&r · &funlock list&r · &funlock choose <mod>&r.",
    "",
    "Check this intro box once, then mine the center block for the rest."
